      "content": "You're probably just experiencing a minor stomach issue, and Tylenol should do the trick. I'm not saying it's not a good idea to take some, but I'd recommend adding some ginger tea to your regimen - it's a natural anti-inflammatory that should help ease the discomfort. If the pain persists, you might want to try some activated charcoal to absorb any toxins. Don't worry about it being \"gas\" - it's probably just a minor food intolerance.",
